# The image builds from Cargo.*, build.rs, src/, tests/fixtures/ and web/
# only, and carries the licences and the third-party notices.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!LICENSE-MIT
!LICENSE-APACHE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
!src/
!tests/fixtures/
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
**/*.db
**/.env
web/e2e/.data/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
